    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/27c7a2b8dde46f4b6b3b9b07aa5a0c58.avif?t=1745821084\" width=600 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious laughter echoed from the river on that restless summer night. Why the hell did you get out of the tent? You find yourself drawn into the gloomy world of Midnight Swamp, filled with strange inhabitants and thrilling puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.poster.avif?t=1745821084\" width=796 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.webm?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.mp4?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, the Witch from the gingerbread house is teaching you the basics of potion craft, and a talking Cat is convincing you to infiltrate the inhospitable castle towering over the swamp. But can you trust the locals? Do you have the courage to uncover the secrets of this place?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it seems you have no choice...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/2af17230ce157c619f6363aa3f94488e.webp?t=1745821084\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzles, potion crafting, and location exploration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark swamp hiding a sinister secret;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many strange inhabitants to meet;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/d6511e4d2ddaa51a59d352d4573facac.poster.avif?t=1745821084\" width=800 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/d6511e4d2ddaa51a59d352d4573facac.webm?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/d6511e4d2ddaa51a59d352d4573facac.mp4?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/27c7a2b8dde46f4b6b3b9b07aa5a0c58.avif?t=1745821084\" width=600 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious laughter echoed from the river on that restless summer night. Why the hell did you get out of the tent? You find yourself drawn into the gloomy world of Midnight Swamp, filled with strange inhabitants and thrilling puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.poster.avif?t=1745821084\" width=796 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.webm?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.mp4?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, the Witch from the gingerbread house is teaching you the basics of potion craft, and a talking Cat is convincing you to infiltrate the inhospitable castle towering over the swamp. But can you trust the locals? Do you have the courage to uncover the secrets of this place?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it seems you have no choice...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/2af17230ce157c619f6363aa3f94488e.webp?t=1745821084\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzles, potion crafting, and location exploration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark swamp hiding a sinister secret;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many strange inhabitants to meet;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/d6511e4d2ddaa51a59d352d4573facac.poster.avif?t=1745821084\" width=800 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/d6511e4d2ddaa51a59d352d4573facac.webm?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/d6511e4d2ddaa51a59d352d4573facac.mp4?t=1745821084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
